   "start": 1043.57,
   "end": 1045.25
  },
  {
   "en": "This lesson is a part of our leadership series.",
   "asr_range": [
    1589,
    1598
   ],
   "start": 1045.49,
   "end": 1048.53
  },
  {
   "en": "Let me start by sharing a story of Richard Rochester, one of the most successful businessmen in Britain.",
   "asr_range": [
    1598,
    1616
   ],
   "start": 1048.77,
   "end": 1055.25
  },
  {
   "en": "Years ago I was given the task of organizing a conference in the south of England.",
   "asr_range": [
    1616,
    1632
   ],
   "start": 1056.1,
   "end": 1061.54
  },
  {
   "en": "I chose a five-star hotel, owned by Rochester, as the venue.",
   "asr_range": [
    1632,
    1644
   ],
   "start": 1061.78,
   "end": 1066.98
  },
  {
   "en": "Susan, the receptionist, helped me arrange everything perfectly.",
   "asr_range": [
    1644,
    1652
   ],
   "start": 1067.22,
   "end": 1071.86
  },
  {
   "en": "Once when we were chatting, I asked Susan if she'd ever met Mr. Rochester.",
   "asr_range": [
    1652,
    1666
   ],
   "start": 1072.72,
   "end": 1078.16
  },
  {
   "en": "She said yes.",
   "asr_range": [
    1666,
    1669
   ],
   "start": 1078.4,
   "end": 1080.0
  },
  {
   "en": "Shortly after Mr. Rochester bought the hotel, he made an appointment to see the hotel manager.",
   "asr_range": [
    1669,
    1685
   ],
   "start": 1080.56,
   "end": 1086.64
  },
  {
   "en": "When he arrived, the first person he met was Susan, who was cleaning the carpet.",
   "asr_range": [
    1685,
    1700
   ],
   "start": 1087.38,
   "end": 1092.66
  },
  {
   "en": "He chatted with Susan for thirty minutes before keeping his appointment with the manager.",
   "asr_range": [
    1700,
    1714
   ],
   "start": 1092.9,
   "end": 1098.34
  },
  {
   "en": "He spent all day at the hotel, talking with each member of the staff, from the top guy to the lady who cleaned the toilets.",
   "asr_range": [
    1714,
    1739
   ],
   "start": 1098.9,
   "end": 1107.06
  },
  {
   "en": "Six months later, Mr. Rochester paid another visit.",
   "asr_range": [
    1739,
    1747
   ],
   "start": 1107.91,
   "end": 1112.07
  },
  {
   "en": "Susan had been promoted to receptionist, but he recognized her immediately, and addressed her by name.",
   "asr_range": [
    1747,
    1763
   ],
   "start": 1112.31,
   "end": 1118.95
  },
  {
   "en": "He even remembered that she had a little girl, and what her name was.",
   "asr_range": [
    1763,
    1777
   ],
   "start": 1119.19,
   "end": 1123.11
  },
  {
   "en": "Now, I don't believe that Richard Rochester has that good a memory.",
   "asr_range": [
    1777,
    1789
   ],
   "start": 1124.03,
   "end": 1128.43
  },
  {
   "en": "He must have written a lot of notes after his first visit, and read them over again before that second visit.",
   "asr_range": [
    1789,
    1810
   ],
   "start": 1128.67,
   "end": 1135.23
  },
  {
